Package: pmc
Type: Package
Title: Population Monte Carlo with Various Resampling Methods
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-07-30
Authors@R: person("Wenjie", "Ma", email="wenjie@example.com", role=c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an implementation of the Population Monte Carlo (PMC)
    algorithm (Cappé et al., 2004) and the Population Quasi-Monte Carlo (PQMC)
    algorithm (Huang et al., 2022). Includes a collection of resampling methods:
    multinomial, residual, systematic, stratified, and support points resampling.
    Also provides Hilbert curve ordering and energy distance computation.
Imports: randtoolbox, gmp
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
NeedsCompilation: no
